# Rare OS: SSH is off by default (owner request; it used to be forced on). Settings > System turns
# it on with `os-admin ssh on`, and rare-keep-ssh.service applies that choice at every boot. The
# base's desktop preset (81-desktop.preset) would otherwise decide for sshd; presets are read in
# order and the first match wins, so this one comes first.
disable sshd.service
enable rare-keep-ssh.service
